From: Amaral Adreno Tools <rickamaral94@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [LAB ONLY] tu: expose A7 queue identity before gated readback counters

The 5.7.11.1 heartbeat never appeared on the Odin despite the correct ELF.
V3 observes actual A7xx IDs and queue path using bounded direct Android logcat
output, before the A740/Eden counting gate. Counting remains A740/Eden-only.
No GPU command, barrier, autotuner or copy-path selection changes.

